    "diagnosis": "Thymoma type&nbsp;A",
    "title": "",
    "legend": "Large tissue fragments of spindle cells without clear cytoplasmic borders, with lymphocytes in the background. The tumour cells will be positive for keratin markers and p63/p40; lymphocytes are positive for TdT (Giemsa).",
