    "diagnosis": "Thymoma type&nbsp;B1",
    "title": "",
    "legend": "B1&nbsp;thymoma shows very high cellularity and a heterogeneous population of lymphocytes and poorly defined tissue fragments of epithelial cells (large cells), best seen by immunocytochemistry for keratins. Lymphocytes are characteristic thymic lymphocytes (TdT-positive) (Giemsa).",
    "source": "Andre L. Moreira",
